    "description": "The Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU-SONAM, has been awarded the Core Four Healthcare Simulation Standards endorsement by the  International Nursing Association of Clinical Simulation and Learning, INACSL , as part of its inaugural endorsement programme for nursing schools and simulation centres worldwide.",
